<title>ITALY: ALPINE SKIING-MEXICAN BARRED FROM DOWNHILL.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-MEXICAN BARRED FROM DOWNHILL.</headline>
<dateline>SESTRIERE, Italy 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's sole skier at</p>
<p>the world championships has been barred from Saturday's men's</p>
<p>downhill.</p>
<p>Race referee Guenther Hujara excluded Hubertus Von Hohenlohe</p>
<p>on &quot;technical grounds&quot; after the playboy prince failed to finish</p>
<p>a final training run on Friday.</p>
<p>Von Hohenlohe was outraged. &quot;After eight world championships</p>
<p>and four Olympics, it's a scandal,&quot; he declared.</p>
</text>
